  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — the package family grows: pqfe ships as the installable dotnet tool PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Tool, and PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Extensions.DependencyInjection adds AddPqFileEncryption()/AddPqHybridFileEncryption() for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection hosts, both versioned in lockstep. Live Rust↔.NET cross-implementation interop CI now round-trips fresh payloads in both directions on every push. Fixes: decryption progress reports the exact plaintext total (Fraction now reaches 1.0); key-material hygiene hardening — the content key is zeroed even when header construction fails, and LocalKekContentKeyProvider.Generate() zeroes its intermediate KEK copy. No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
